#only("3-")[- Seek outside perspectives]
#only("1")[
#voiceover("Awareness is another important strategy. By being mindful of their own thinking and decision-making processes, investors can catch themselves when biases may be creeping in.")
]
#only("2")[
#voiceover("When faced with a financial decision, pausing to reflect on whether biases are at play can help investors avoid hasty or emotionally-driven choices.")
]
#only("3")[
#voiceover("Seeking outside perspectives, such as from a financial advisor or by discussing with a diverse group, can also help challenge biases and bring more objectivity to the decision-making process.")
]
]

